    "qualification": "MC hold window is explicit balance config, not reconstructed original timer semantics. P1 TimerSet 9728 = 26.6667 s with RandomRange = 1; TimerCompare 10676 comparison hash remains unresolved. Legacy EXPOSED action table is historical one-pass evidence; GreeneMotion supplies the new state schedule."
  },
  "changes": [
    "Three independent 90-point appendages and 10-tick local hit clocks; accepted limb damage does not chip body HP or share body invulnerability.",
    "All three broken appendages cancel pending attacks and expose the body; down hit overlay does not reset the cycle.",
    "Rise completes before defenses return; phase advances by completed cycles rather than arbitrary body-health thresholds.",
    "Save/load preserves armor, local hit cooldowns, explicit hold duration and current cycle age without offline catch-up.",
    "Existing 150 authored cubes drive native proxies. Nonuniform bone scale plus rotated cubes retains affine/sheared receiving surfaces.",
    "Physics origin stays separate from animated receiving bounds; rooted Greene rejects push/knockback. Frustum bounds include posed proxies.",
    "Accepted appendage hits use local tissue feedback; collapse/recovery invoke existing ERUPT/MEND cues. Metallic limb-break cue removed for Greene."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Entry and death choreography, source projectile sockets and wave cover validation remain pending.",
    "No new geometry or texture was authored in this batch. Existing authored body has 150 runtime cuboids; older surface provenance describes an earlier asset revision.",
    "Native QA uses two headings, a flat disposable arena, goals removed but physics active, six high-damage native arrows to appendages and two low-damage body arrows per loader.",
    "Hidden muted clients verify visual/contact/state behavior; no listening assessment or dedicated multiplayer test was performed.",
    "No user worlds, install, release JAR, commit or publication. Writes and caches remain on D:."
  ],
